 words, a closed set consists of all the interior and all the boundary points of the set.\n\nLet's examine our sets in turn.\n\n- The first set is *neither open nor closed*. It contains some of its boundary points, for example, the point $(1,3).$ On the other hand, it does not contain some other boundary points, for example, the point $(2,3).$\n\n- The second set is *open* since it doesn't contain any of its boundary points (the corresponding inequality is strict).\n\n- The third set is *closed* since it contains all its boundary points (all the corresponding inequalities are not strict).\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only.\""} :step/id #uuid "d4a32acc-c162-55a3-84e9-b8804219af5e" :step/next {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186481683}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186481741 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186193377 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a79b038c-fe01-5ebc-866e-1019c3411829" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186460161} {:answer/id #uuid "7e520372-4f2a-52fe-80ef-779b4c47f5ff" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186460162}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186460162} :answer-field/id #uuid "0f28ff6b-8064-54e6-ac2a-cbfc20687b92" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186460947} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ebc8c9ed-7eb1-530d-8dc2-74b72a9c7683" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186460163} {:answer/id #uuid "c32fe42f-7550-5e6f-89b8-a8cf262268b1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186460164}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186460163} :answer-field/id #uuid "a6c4ff18-793c-5bf5-b61b-dc2775e56694" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186460948} {:answer-field/choices [{:ans